            </li>\\n                                                                <!-- Level 2 Link -->\\n                                                                <li id=\"x133013-parent-side-nav\" class=\"custom-accordion-menu-li \" data-level=\"2\">\\n                                                                    <a class=\" side-navigation-link\" href=\"https://www.unr.edu/scheduling-services/academic-scheduling/centrally-scheduled-classrooms\" data-ga4=\"nav-local-menu-level-2-link\" data-ga4-category=\"navigation\" data-ga4-sub=\"local\">\\n\\n                                                                        \\n                                                                        Centrally scheduled classroom capacities\\n\\n                                                                    </a>\\n\\n                                                                </li>\\n                                                                <!-- Level 2 Link -->\\n                                                                <li id=\"x138603-parent-side-nav\" class=\"custom-accordion-menu-li \" data-level=\"2\">\\n                                                                    <a class=\" side-navigation-link\" href=\"https://www.unr.edu/scheduling-services/academic-scheduling/glossary\" data-ga4=\"nav-local-menu-level-2-link\" data-ga4-category=\"navigation\" data-ga4-sub=\"local\">\\n\\n                                                                        \\n                                                                        Instruction mode and course section code glossary\\n\\n                                                                    </a>\\n\\n                                                                </li>\\n                                                                <!-- Level 2 Link -->\\n                                                                <li id=\"x133168-parent-side-nav\" class=\"custom-accordion-menu-li \" data-level=\"2\">\\n                                                                    <a class=\" side-navigation-link\" href=\"https://www.unr.edu/scheduling-services/academic-scheduling/instructional-space-scheduling\" data-ga4=\"nav-local-menu-level-2-link\" data-ga4-category=\"navigation\" data-ga4-sub=\"local\">\\n\\n                                                                        \\n                                                                        Instructional space scheduling policy\\n\\n                                                                    </a>\\n\\n                                                                </li>\\n                                                                <!-- Level 2 Link -->\\n                                                                <li id=\"x138568-parent-side-nav\" class=\"custom-accordion-menu-li \" data-level=\"2\">\\n                                                                    <a class=\" side-navigation-link\" href=\"https://www.unr.edu/scheduling-services/academic-scheduling/standard-meeting-patterns\" data-ga4=\"nav-local-menu-level-2-link\" data-ga4-category=\"navigation\" data-ga4-sub=\"local\">\\n\\n                                                                        \\n                                                                        Standard meeting patterns\\n\\n                                                                    </a>\\n\\n                                                                </li>\\n                                                    </ul>\\n                                            </li>\\n                                </ul>\\n                            </div>\\n                        </li>\\n                    </ul>\\n                </div>\\n            </div>\\n        </nav>\\n\\n                </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n    \\n    <div class=\"grid-x align-justify max-width\">\\n\\n            <main id=\"main-content\" class=\"cell section-detail-main small-12\">\\n                <div class=\"inner-content\">\\n                    <h1>Finals schedule</h1>\\n                        <div class=\"body-copy-wrapper\" >\\n<p>A two-hour time period is allotted for each final class meeting. All classes are required to meet during the final week of instruction at the appropriate time and dates indicated below.</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li><em>Four credit, MTWR classes will hold final exams based on the MW regular class occurrence. </em></li>\\n<li><em>If you have an irresolvable conflict during the final week of classes, contact your instructor to arrange an alternative.</em></li>\\n</ul>\\n<h2 class=\"text-align-center\">Wednesday, Prep Day</h2>\\n<p class=\"text-align-center\">No classes held. Prepare for final week of instruction and testing.</p>\\n<h2 class=\"text-align-center\">Thursday</h2>\\n<table class=\"footable\"><caption>Thursday, First day of finals</caption>\\n<thead>\\n<tr>\\n<th><strong>Class Time</strong></th>\\n<th class=\"breakpoint-sm\"><strong>Class Day(s)</strong></th>\\n<th class=\"breakpoint-sm\"><strong>Final Meeting Time</strong></th>\\n</tr>\\n</thead>\\n<tbody>\\n<tr>\\n<td>8:30 a.m.</td>\\n<td>Tuesday/Thursday (TR)</td>\\n<td>8-10 a.m.</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>9 a.m.</td>\\n<td>Tuesday/Thursday (TR) or Thursday (R)</td>\\n<td>8-10 a.m.</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>11:30 a.m.</td>\\n<td>Tuesday/Thursday (TR)</td>\\n<td>10:15 a.m.-12:15 p.m.</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>12 p.m.</td>\\n<td>Tuesday/Thursday (TR)</td>\\n<td>10:15 a.m.-12:15 p.m.</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>1:30 p.m.</td>\\n<td>Thursday (R)</td>\\n<td>12:45-2:45 p.m.</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>3 p.m.</td>\\n<td>Tuesday/Thursday (TR) or Thursday (R)</td>\\n<td>3-5 p.m.</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>4:30 p.m.</td>\\n<td>Thursday (R)</td>\\n<td>5:30-7:30 p.m.</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>6 p.m.</td>\\n<td>Tuesday/Thursday (TR) or Thursday (R)</td>\\n<td>5:30-7:30 p.m.</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>7:30 p.m.</td>\\n<td>Thursday (R)</td>\\n<td>7:45-9:45 p.m.</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>9 p.m.</td>\\n<td>Tuesday/Thursday (TR)</td>\\n<td>7:45-9:45 p.m.</td>\\n</tr>\\n</tbody>\\n</table>\\n<h2 class=\"text-align-center\">Friday</h2>\\n<table class=\"footable\"><caption>Friday, Second day of finals</caption>\\n<thead>\\n<tr>\\n<th><strong>Class Time</strong></th>\\n<th class=\"breakpoint-sm\">Class Day(s)</th>\\n<th class=\"breakpoint-sm\"><strong>Final Meeting Time</strong></th>\\n</tr>\\n</thead>\\n<tbody>\\n<tr>\\n<td>8 a.m.</td>\\n<td>Monday/Wednesday/Friday (MWF) or Monday/Wednesday (MW)</td>\\n<td>8-10 a.m.</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>9 a.m.</td>\\n<td>Friday (F)</td>\\n<td>10:15 a.m.-12:15 p.m.</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>10 a.m.</td>\\n<td>Monday/Wednesday/Friday (MWF)</td>\\n<td>10:15 a.m.-12:15 p.m.</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>1 p.m.</td>\\n<td>Monday/Wednesday/Friday (MWF) or Friday (F)</td>\\n<td>12:45-2:45 p.m.</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>2:30 p.m.</td>\\n<td>Friday (F)</td>\\n<td>3-5 p.m.</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>3 p.m.</td>\\n<td>Monday/Wednesday/Friday (MWF)</td>\\n<td>3-5 p.m.</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>4 p.m.</td>\\n<td>Friday (F)</td>\\n<td>5:30-7:30 p.m.</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>5:30 p.m.</td>\\n<td>Friday (F)</td>\\n<td>5:30-7:30 p.m.</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>7 p.m.</td>\\n<td>Friday (F)</td>\\n<td>7:45-9:45 p.m.</td>\\n</tr>\\n</tbody>\\n</table>\\n<h2 class=\"text-align-center\">Saturday</h2>\\n<table class=\"footable\"><caption>Saturday, Conflicts</caption>\\n<thead>\\n<tr>\\n<th>Class Time</th>\\n<th class=\"breakpoint-sm\"><strong>Class Day(s)</strong></th>\\n<th class=\"breakpoint-sm\"><strong>Final Meeting Time</strong></th>\\n</tr>\\n</thead>\\n<tbody>\\n<tr>\\n<td>*Conflicts</td>\\n<td>Varies</td>\\n<td>10:15 a.m.-12:15 p.m.</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>*Conflicts</td>\\n<td>Varies</td>\\n<td>12:45-2:45 p.m.</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>*Conflicts</td>\\n<td>Varies</td>\\n<td>3-5 p.m.</td>\\n</tr>\\n</tbody>\\n</table>\\n<h2 class=\"text-align-center\">Monday</h2>\\n<ta